---
description: Prepare one interpretCollection evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ExhibitionProject[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Read artifact records, scholarship, provenance, and conservation guidance to identify what can be responsibly said and displayed. Separate documented facts from contested interpretations and preserve restrictions on handling, light, duration, or cultural presentation. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
